%% Phase3 / channel / MV3-G08d 退出群
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/visual/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/channel/mv3-g08d/contract.json
%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/services/channelConfigBase.service.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/components/drawer/chat-settings/chat-settings.component.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点「退出群聊」，自己的会话列表里这个群消失；群内其他人看到「X 退出了群聊」，成员列表少一人。
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=partial；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: channelLeave(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_channel_leave", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_channel_leave", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_channel_leave", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 成员主动退群 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /channel/member/leave
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction channel + members + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（im:channel:closed，im:channel:member-updated）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ 原始事件 → adapter 映射 kind → Angular 消费
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：退群者侧频道从会话集合移除（channels.get(channelId) === undefined）；退群者侧该 channelId 的加急/@我待办项清零（cleanupTodoItemsForChannel → DELETE_TODO_ITEM）
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：退群不得触发群内其他成员的会话消失：其他成员侧 channels 集合必须仍含该 channelId（只有 MV3-G08c 关群才双侧移除）；不得新增 ImGateEvent left kind；必须复用 channelClosed，并以 terminalReason='left' 与解散群的 closed 区分
  Note over E,Sink: 原始事件名（按触发分支）：im:channel:closed，im:channel:member-updated；客户端 kind/action 由 adapter 映射，不是原始 Emit 名称
